# .gitattributes
# Line endings: store and check out text files with LF (the Linux style), also on Windows.
# The app runs on Linux (Docker, Render, the Nebius VM), where a Windows line ending (CRLF)
# can break a shell command or a Dockerfile line, and it keeps the git history free of
# "every line changed" diffs that are only line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are binary: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
